-- Seed data: HPCRMS branches and fleet (United States)
-- Uses ON CONFLICT so this is safe to run every startup without duplicating
-- rows. For an existing database with the OLD Jamaica seed data already
-- committed, this will NOT retroactively rename those rows (ON CONFLICT
-- DO NOTHING only skips inserts, it never updates) — see the accompanying
-- migration notes for how to fully refresh an existing dev database.

ON CONFLICT (name) DO NOTHING;

ON CONFLICT (license_plate) DO NOTHING;
